  "description": "The \"second\" season of Dongitsune: a series of animated commercials for Nissin’s line of Donbei Kitsune Udon instant noodles.<br><br>\nEpisodes:<br>\n#1) どんぎつねシーズン2 秋祭 篇 / Dongitsune Season 2: Akimatsuri-hen [September 28, 2022].<br>\n#2) どんぎつねシーズン2 耳そこなんですか？ 篇 / Dongitsune Season 2: Mimi Soko Nandesu ka?-hen [October 31, 2022].<br>\n#3) 最強のどんぎつね現るッッ / Saikyou no Dongitsune Arawaru [November 21, 2022]. <br>\n#4) 最強年越し 篇 / Saikyou Toshikoshi-hen [December 1, 2022].<br>\n#5) 正直すぎる尻尾 篇 / Shoujiki Sugiru Shippo-hen [February 15, 2023].<br>\n#6) カップよりうまい 篇 / Cup Yori Umai-hen [March 30, 2023].<br>\n#7) どん兵衛プロ出た 篇 / Donbei PRO Deta-hen [September 7, 2023].<br>\n#8) 耳は正直 2023 篇 / Mimi wa Shoujiki 2023-hen [November 15, 2023].<br>\n#9) 年越しアイドル 篇 / Toshikoshi Idol-hen [December 9, 2023]. <br>\n#10) 片翼のどんぎつね 篇 / Henyoku no Dongitsune-hen [February 28, 2024].<br>\n<br>\n<i>Note: The “first” season was a series of live-action commercials starring Riho Yoshioka and Gen Hoshino.</i>",
